                                <strong style="color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic;">Keywords:</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic;">SmartDCA, RSI-14, Volume Surge, Trailing Exit, Futures Leverage, Liquidation Threshold, Multi-Coin Portfolio.</span>
                            </div>
